OL,5,G2130 The History of the Weekend
OL,6,     FOn May 1st 1926, Ford introduced
OL,7,     Fthe standard five day week. One
OL,8,     Fhundred years later, Siofra
OL,9,     FMulqueen takes a look at the
OL,10,     Fhistory of the weekend & asks
OL,11,     Fshould we be reexamining it.
OL,12,G2200 The Late Debate
OL,13,     FCormac O hEadhra brings you live
OL,14,     Fdebate, in-depth interviews and
OL,15,     Fanalysis of the political stories
OL,16,     Fof the day.
OL,17,G2300 Late Date
OL,18,     FThe perfect musical end to the
OL,19,     Fday, presented by Cathal Murray.
